    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hoosheeca, Boqorkii Ugu Dambeeyey Ee Israa'iil",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aaxaas oo ahaa boqorkii dalka Yahuudah sannaddiisii laba iyo tobnaad ayaa Hoosheeca ina Eelaah dalka Israa'iil Samaariya boqor ugu noqday, oo wuxuu boqor ahaa sagaal sannadood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu sameeyey wax shar ku ah Rabbiga hortiisa, laakiinse uma uu samayn sidii boqorradii dalka Israa'iil oo isaga ka horreeyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa isagii ku kacay Shalmaneser oo ahaa boqorkii Ashuur; oo Hoosheeca addoon buu u noqday isagii, oo wuxuu u keenay gabbaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii Ashuur wuxuu Hoosheeca ka gartay sirqool, waayo, wuxuu wargeeyayaal u dirtay Soowa oo boqorkii Masar ahaa, oo boqorkii Ashuurna gabbaro ma uu siin siduu sannad kasta yeeli jiray; sidaas daraaddeed boqorkii Ashuur wuu xidhay oo xabsi ku riday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii Ashuur dalkii oo dhan dhex maray, oo wuxuu yimid Samaariya, oo intii saddex sannadood ah ayuu hareereeyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Hoosheeca sannaddiisii sagaalaad ayaa boqorkii Ashuur qabsaday Samaariya, oo dadkii Israa'iilna wuxuu u kaxaystay Ashuur, oo wuxuu dejiyey Xalax, iyo Xaaboor oo webigii Goosaan ag ahaa, iyo magaalooyinkii reer Maaday.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Reer Binu Israa'iil Oo Dembigooda Loo Masaafuriyey",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo taasu way dhacday, maxaa yeelay, dadkii Israa'iil waxay ku dembaabi jireen Rabbiga Ilaahooda ah oo iyaga ka soo bixiyey dalkii Masar oo ka soo hoos bixiyey gacantii Fircoon oo ahaa boqorkii Masar, oo waxay ka cabsan jireen ilaahyo kale, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wayna ku socon jireen qaynuunnadii quruumaha kale, kuwaasoo Rabbigu ka eryay dadka Israa'iil hortooda, iyo kuwii ay boqorradii dadkii Israa'iil samaysteenba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii Israa'iil waxay Rabbiga Ilaahooda ah si qarsoon ugu samayn jireen waxyaalo aan qummanayn, oo magaalooyinkooda oo dhan waxay ka dhisan jireen meelo sarsare tan iyo munaaraddii waardiyayaasha iyo ilaa magaaladii deyrka lahayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo buur kasta oo dheer korkeeda iyo geed kastoo dheer oo doog ah hoostiisaba waxay qotonsan jireen tiirar iyo geedihii Asheeraah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meelihii sarsare oo dhan waxay ku shidi jireen foox sidii ay yeeli jireen quruumihii kale oo Rabbigu uu hortooda ka eryay; oo waxay samayn jireen waxyaalo shar ah oo ay Rabbiga kaga xanaajiyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay u adeegi jireen sanamyadii uu Rabbigu ku yidhi, Idinku waxan ha samaynina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Rabbigu dadkii Israa'iil iyo dadkii Yahuudahba wuxuu ugu digi jiray nebiyadii oo dhan iyo kuwii wax arki jiray oo dhan, isagoo leh, War jidadkiinna sharka ah ka soo noqda, oo amarradayda iyo qaynuunnadayda u dhawra siduu ahaa sharcigii aan awowayaashiin ku amray oo dhan oo aan idinkugu soo dhiibay addoommadaydii nebiyada ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase yeeshee iyagu way diidi jireen inay taas maqlaan, laakiinse waxay u madax adkaan jireen sidii awowayaashood oo kale, kuwaasoo aan rumaysan Rabbiga Ilaahooda ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyagu way diidi jireen qaynuunnadiisii iyo axdigiisii uu awowayaashood la dhigtay, iyo markhaatifurkiisii uu iyaga ugu marag furay, oo intay waxtarla'aan raaceen ayay wax aan waxba tarin noqdeen, oo waxay ku dayan jireen quruumihii hareerahooda ku wareegsanaa oo Rabbigu ku amray inayan sidooda oo kale yeelin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyagu way ka tegi jireen amarradii Rabbiga Ilaahooda ah oo dhan, oo waxay samaysteen sanamyo la shubay, kuwaasoo ahaa laba weylood, oo waxay kaloo samaysteen geedihii Asheeraah, oo waxay caabudi jireen ciidanka samada oo dhan, Bacalna way u adeegi jireen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wiilashoodii iyo gabdhahoodii ayay dab dhex marin jireen, oo waxay u tegi jireen waxsheegyo iyo falanfallowyo, oo waxay nafsaddoodii u iibin jireen inay sameeyaan wax shar ku ah Rabbiga hortiisa, oo ay kaga xanaajiyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Rabbigu aad buu ugu cadhooday reer binu Israa'iil, markaasuu hortiisa ka fogeeyey; oo iyagii waxba kama hadhin qabiilkii Yahuudah oo keliya mooyaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo xataa reer Yahuudahna ma ayan dhawrin amarradii Rabbiga Ilaahooda ah, laakiinse waxay ku socdeen qaynuunnadii ay dadkii Israa'iil sameeyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu wuxuu nacay farcankii reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan, oo intuu dhibay ayuu gacanta u geliyey kuwii dhacay ilaa uu hortiisa ka tuuray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, isagu reer binu Israa'iil wuu ka soocay Daa'uud reerkiisii, oo waxay boqor ka dhigteen Yaaraabcaam ina Nebaad, oo Yaaraabcaamna dadkii Israa'iil wuu ka kaxeeyey Rabbiga lasocodkiisii, oo wuxuu iyagii dembaajiyey dembi weyn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii Israa'iil waxay ku socdeen kulli dembiyadii Yaaraabcaam sameeyey oo dhan, oo kuwaasna kama ay tegin ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilaa uu Rabbigu dadkii Israa'iil hortiisa ka fogeeyey, siduu kaga hadli jiray addoommadiisii nebiyada ahaa oo dhan. Oo sidaas daraaddeed dadkii Israa'iil waa laga kaxaystay dalkoodii, oo waxaa lala tegey dalka Ashuur, halkaasoo ay ilaa maantadan joogaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dad La Dejiyey Samaariya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii Ashuur dad ka keenay xagga Baabuloon, iyo Kuutaah, iyo Cawaa, iyo Xamaad, iyo Sefarwayiim, oo wuxuu dejiyey magaalooyinkii Samaariya, meeshay dadkii Israa'iil ka degganaan jireen, oo waxay hantiyeen Samaariya, magaalooyinkeediina way degeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markay bilaabeen inay meeshaas degaan Rabbiga kama ay cabsan jirin, oo sidaas daraaddeed Rabbigu wuxuu dhexdooda u soo diray libaaxyo, kuwaasoo iyagii qaar ka laayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed boqorkii Ashuur ayaa lala hadlay oo lagu yidhi, War quruumihii aad kaxaysay oo aad magaalooyinka Samaariya dejisay ma ay yaqaaniin camalka Ilaaha dalkaas, oo sidaas daraaddeed wuxuu dhexdooda u soo diray libaaxyo, oo bal eeg, libaaxyadu way laayaan, maxaa yeelay, iyagu ma ay yaqaaniin camalka Ilaaha dalkaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii Ashuur wuxuu bixiyey amar, oo yidhi, Wadaaddadii aad ka soo kaxayseen midkood halkaas ku celiya, oo halkaas ha tago oo ha dego, dadkana ha baro camalka Ilaaha dalkaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba wadaaddadii ay Samaariya ka soo kaxeeyeen midkood ayaa yimid, oo wuxuu degay Beytel, oo wuxuu dadkii baray siday Rabbiga uga cabsan lahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase yeeshee quruun waluba waxay samaysatay ilaahyo ay iyagu leeyihiin, oo waxay dhex dhigteen guryihii meelaha sarsare oo ay reer Samaariya samaysteen, oo quruun waluba waxay dhex dhigteen magaalooyinkii ay iyagu degganaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii reer Baabuloon waxay samaysteen Sukood Benood, dadkii reer Kuudna waxay samaysteen Neergal, dadkii reer Xamaadna waxay samaysteen Ashiimaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo reer Cawaana waxay samaysteen Nibxas iyo Tartaq, oo reer Sefarwayiimna waxay carruurtoodii dab ugu gubeen Adrammeleg iyo Canammeleg oo ahaa ilaahyadii reer Sefarwayiim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbiga way ka cabsan jireen oo waxay dadkooda ka dooran jireen wadaaddadii meelaha sarsare, kuwaasoo ugu allabaryi jiray guryihii meelaha sarsare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbiga way ka cabsan jireen, isla markaasna waxay u adeegi jireen ilaahyadoodii sidii quruumihii iyaga laga soo dhex kaxeeyey ay yeeli jireen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo ilaa maantadan waxay sameeyaan sidii caadooyinkoodii hore ay ahaayeen, oo Rabbiga kama cabsadaan, mana ay sameeyaan qaynuunnadoodii, iyo xukummadoodii, iyo sharcigii iyo amarkii uu Rabbigu amray reer Yacquub, kii uu Israa'iil u bixiyey, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuwaasoo uu Rabbigu axdi la dhigtay, oo uu ku amray, isagoo leh, Idinku ilaahyo kale ha ka cabsanina, hana u sujuudina, hana u adeegina, allabarina ha u bixinina; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laakiinse waxaad ka cabsataan Rabbigii dalkii Masar idinkaga soo bixiyey xoogga weyn iyo cudud fidsan, isagana u sujuuda oo allabari u bixiya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo qaynuunnadii, iyo xukummadii, iyo sharcigii, iyo amarkii uu idiin qoray waa inaad dhawrtaan oo aad weligiinba samaysaan, oo waa inaydnaan ka cabsan ilaahyo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo axdigii aan idinla dhigtayna waa inaydnaan illoobin, oo aydnaan ilaahyo kale ka cabsan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laakiinse waxaad ka cabsataan Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah, oo isna wuxuu idinka samatabbixin doonaa gacanta cadaawayaashiinna oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase yeeshee iyagu ma ayan dhegaysan, laakiinse waxay sameeyeen sidii caadadoodii hore ay ahayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Quruumahaasu waxay ka cabsan jireen Rabbiga, isla markaasna waxay u adeegi jireen sanamyadoodii xardhanaa, oo carruurtoodiina saasoo kalay yeeleen, oo carruurtii carruurtooduna saasoo kalay yeeleen, oo sidii awowayaashood samayn jireen ayay iyaguna sameeyaan ilaa maantadan la joogo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
